-- Add a field to the tree node class of valid. This means every other method in the class needs to account for this field. findMin and findMax become difficult to handle.


****AVL Trees (height bound at O(logN)) - MUST ALSO BE A VALID BINARY SEARCH TREE*****
left to right increasing
height of the left subtree cannot differ from the height of the right subtree by +1. Has to hold true at EVERY LEVEL.
NULL Links have heights of -1

